    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve dabbled with online calculators and YouTube tutorials, but nothing serious. The apps seemed too clinical, like robots explaining rules without passion. I tried one AI tool last year, but it gave me answers too fast—no real understanding. Math needs patience, and AI lacks the human touch. Maybe for others, but not for me.",
